# ---- never commit: key material and identity -------------------------------
# deskflow.pem is cert AND private key in one file (the Barrier convention,
# README section 7). The trusted-* files are per-install and regenerated by
# install.sh, so there is nothing to gain by tracking them either.
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
trusted-clients
trusted-servers
authorized_keys
authorized_keys*
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
known_hosts*

# ---- runtime output, not configuration -------------------------------------
# These hold live IPs, TLS fingerprints and session ids. Useful locally while
# debugging, meaningless to a rebuild.
*.log
logs/
resume

# ---- local safety copies ---------------------------------------------------
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.orig
*~
